# The canon itself is meant to be committed. These are not:
# `seen` is this machine's ingest state, `draft-runs/` is the
# evidence from its model runs, and `config` is the endpoint and
# model name on ONE machine — a fresh clone should say "no endpoint
# configured", not fail against a port on somebody else's laptop.
# None of them is an act.
seen
draft-runs/
config
lineages/
